---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const seo = {
  page_description: "About The Cayman Journal: the definitive source for business, finance, and expat news in the Cayman Islands.",
  canonical_url: "/about/",
  open_graph_type: "website"
};
---
<Layout seo={seo} title="About Us | The Cayman Journal">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-16 px-6 prose">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6 text-navy-900">About The Cayman Journal</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-8">
      The Cayman Journal is an independent, specialized publication dedicated to the business, financial, and expatriate communities of the Cayman Islands.
    </p>

    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>
      We aim to cut through the noise of general news to deliver actionable intelligence, regulatory clarity, and practical guidance. Whether you are structuring an offshore fund, navigating economic substance requirements, or relocating your family to Grand Cayman, our resources are built to give you the precise information you need.
    </p>

    <h2>Why We Are Different</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Niche Focus:</strong> We do not cover local crime, politics, or general Caribbean news. We focus 100% on corporate finance, real estate, regulation, and expat living.</li>
      <li><strong>Data-Driven:</strong> Our guides and tools are built on verified data and primary legal sources, not hearsay.</li>
      <li><strong>No Jargon:</strong> We explain complex structures in plain English.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact the Editorial Team</h2>
    <p>
      Have a story tip, a regulatory update, or feedback on our tools? Reach out to us via our <a href="/contact/">Contact Page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
